# Who may JOIN this team's pairing sessions.
#
# One public key per line, OpenSSH authorized_keys format; the comment at
# the end is free text, use it for "name@device":
#   ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAA... jan@macbook
#
# Participants get their line by running ./join (or .\join.ps1) once, and
# add it via a pull request. Hosts pick up changes by pulling this repo and
# re-running the pairing-setup installer. More: pairing-setup's docs/join.md.
